1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:14,420
I was looking forward to possibly working with the Schomburg Institute, but I was told that essentially they have people who seek out book events and they very rarely do unsolicited book events.

2
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,600
And this would not be one of those times.

3
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:22,340
Thus, if I would like to rent the space, they would be more than willing.

4
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:27,240
However, they did note that that would not be an endorsement of my work by the Schomburg Institute.

5
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:29,520
Noted.

